# Project Architecture

This is a Django application with:

- Main project in `/kitchen_management/`
- Pantry application in `/kitchen_management/pantry`
- Meal plans application in `/kitchen_management/meal_plans`
- Shopping list application in `/kitchen_management/shopping_list`
- Database in `/kitchen_management/db.sqlite`

## Coding Standards

- Use Python for all new files
- Follow the existing naming conventions
- Write tests for all new features
